お任せします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/i/events/1351762189556715523", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kisetsusuzu/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 415988, "client_id": 813133, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ff4ce948/requests/194764_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae527c9fb11bc3b1c67154f7410c3c5c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ff4ce948/requests/194764_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae527c9fb11bc3b1c67154f7410c3c5c, https://si.imgix.net/ff4ce948/requests/194764_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6c7b3634ef34464e8ad3129e787a51b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ff4ce948/requests/194764_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5cbe6167fdcef5c5b42b200bf1ea400d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ff4ce948/requests/194764_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=47eff01e9946c938802b557c1a16e119", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ff4ce948/requests/194764_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=47eff01e9946c938802b557c1a16e119, https://si.imgix.net/ff4ce948/requests/194764_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=55f9fe24a7d651bb0b89b9beefa89924 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ff4ce948/requests/194764_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c3d27bbffd620c35791e1a52cfd9293b 3x"}, "body": "初めまして！Vtuber準備中の天幽カフネ(amakura cafune)と申します。\nすずしな綺雪様の綺麗な絵が一目見てとても好きになりました。\nですので自身をお願いしようと思いリクエストを送りました。\n\nキャラ：天幽カフネ(男)\n全身立ち絵：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1W82ONUGaJlqYfKdt7bnViJPKKSjC